        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ploko, a VR adventure full of creativity and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Please note:</u> Ploko is a short and cozy first project (around 2h for new players). Made with love, it’s small in scope but full of charm, we hope you’ll enjoy the journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 BUILD MINIATURE WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where <i>you’re the creator</i>. Enjoy piecing together enchanting dioramas that come to life in themed landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.poster.avif?t=1772530761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.webm?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.mp4?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📷 CAPTURE MOMENTS AND UNCOVER SECRETS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Polaroid camera, aim, snap… and sometimes, Ploko himself has hidden surprises waiting in your photos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.poster.avif?t=1772530761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.webm?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.mp4?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 FOLLOW CLUES TO UNVEIL STORIES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama hides a mysterious story only you can reveal. Solve the photo challenges to learn more about Ploko’s secret life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏞️ EXPLORE A VARIETY OF ATHMOSPHERES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From serene Japanese gardens to bustling city streets, each level has its own unique style and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 A FELINE COMPANION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploko, your friendly sidekick, accompanies you on your adventure, adding warmth and mystery to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌈 EXPRESS YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing relaxation and wonder, Ploko immerses you in a unique VR experience where each diorama invites you to dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Note from the team:</u> <br>We want to be upfront, content is limited since this is our debut project, but we hope you’ll enjoy the cozy atmosphere, the playful riddles, and the charm we tried to bring into every diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for giving Ploko a chance! Your feedback means a lot and helps us grow as developers. We kindly ask you to keep this in mind and approach the game with a bit of kindness, it really makes a difference. 💖 </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ploko, a VR adventure full of creativity and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Please note:</u> Ploko is a short and cozy first project (around 2h for new players). Made with love, it’s small in scope but full of charm, we hope you’ll enjoy the journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 BUILD MINIATURE WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where <i>you’re the creator</i>. Enjoy piecing together enchanting dioramas that come to life in themed landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.poster.avif?t=1772530761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.webm?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.mp4?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📷 CAPTURE MOMENTS AND UNCOVER SECRETS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Polaroid camera, aim, snap… and sometimes, Ploko himself has hidden surprises waiting in your photos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.poster.avif?t=1772530761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.webm?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.mp4?t=1772530761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 FOLLOW CLUES TO UNVEIL STORIES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama hides a mysterious story only you can reveal. Solve the photo challenges to learn more about Ploko’s secret life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏞️ EXPLORE A VARIETY OF ATHMOSPHERES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From serene Japanese gardens to bustling city streets, each level has its own unique style and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 A FELINE COMPANION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploko, your friendly sidekick, accompanies you on your adventure, adding warmth and mystery to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌈 EXPRESS YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing relaxation and wonder, Ploko immerses you in a unique VR experience where each diorama invites you to dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Note from the team:</u> <br>We want to be upfront, content is limited since this is our debut project, but we hope you’ll enjoy the cozy atmosphere, the playful riddles, and the charm we tried to bring into every diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for giving Ploko a chance! Your feedback means a lot and helps us grow as developers. We kindly ask you to keep this in mind and approach the game with a bit of kindness, it really makes a difference. 💖 </p>",
        "short_description": "Ploko is a relaxing VR experience where each model you build comes to life before your very eyes. With your camera, explore these miniature worlds, discover their hidden secrets and let your imagination run wild.",
